# The face from the voice in the game, close up and with sound (reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/engine-plan.md,
# step 10, "FaceRig"): Vino with an own head says four lines of his original voice, each with a face track of
# Audio2Face lying next to the head as <sound>.face.json - two with lip sounds м, п, б and у, then the two long lines of
# face-brows-clip.bench over S_ANGRY (with an emotion in their tracks the expression gives way to it, without one it
# shows over the track). No AI server. Needs an own head for BAU_952_VINO whose face profile has speech_face;
# OPENGOTHIC_SPEECH_FACE=0 films the same without the layer (the mouth by loudness, the brows on the accents).
# How to run it and make the clip - scripts/bench/README.md, "Speech face clip".
# @timeout 300
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
# the near clip 30 cm before the mouth: Vino stands a little above the hero and bends his head to him, at 15 cm the
# clip cut his forehead
view clean 30
overlay off
goto NW_FARM1_PATH_01
wait 3000
freeze BAU_952_VINO
# to the hero's left: the sun on his face (straight ahead it is behind him)
put BAU_952_VINO 200 90
watch BAU_952_VINO
wait 1500
# a little below the mouth: Vino bends his head about 9 degrees down to the hero, from above the face reads badly
cam face 45 0 -8
wait 1000
rec clip
wait 500
speak BAU_952_VINO DIA_Vino_SEEKWORK_05_04
wait 11800
speak BAU_952_VINO DIA_Vino_PERM45UND6_05_03
wait 7600
faceanim BAU_952_VINO S_ANGRY 23000
speak BAU_952_VINO DIA_Vino_HALLO_05_02
wait 10700
speak BAU_952_VINO DIA_Vino_PERM_05_04
wait 11500
stop
